__baseline__.text:
React 18 Strict Mode, dev only. Deliberate double-invoke: mount → unmount → mount. Purpose: surface effects not cleaning up right.

Why matters: catches missing cleanup (subscriptions, timers, listeners) before prod bites you.

Fix path (rarely "fix" — usually correct):
```js
useEffect(() => {
  const sub = subscribe();
  return () => sub.unsubscribe(); // cleanup required
}, []);
```
Add cleanup → double-run harmless (mount→unmount→remount, net same state).

Prod build: no double-invoke, StrictMode dev-only.

Don't disable StrictMode to "fix" — masks real bugs.

