hmd_full.text:
StrictMode double-invoke it. React 18 dev only, not prod.

Why: React mount→unmount→remount components once, to surface effects that don't clean up right. Simulates future remount behavior (offscreen/resumable state).

Fix: don't fight it. Add proper cleanup:

```js
useEffect(() => {
  const controller = new AbortController();
  fetchData(controller.signal);
  return () => controller.abort();
}, []);
```

If effect breaks under double-invoke → real bug (missing cleanup), StrictMode just exposed it early. Prod build unaffected either way.
